Description: lightning-fast ASGI server implementation (Python 3)
 Uvicorn is an ASGI web server implementation for Python, supporting
 HTTP/1.1 and WebSockets.
 .
 This package is built from a newer upstream release than the one
 shipped by Debian, in order to provide the
 uvicorn.protocols.websockets.websockets_sansio_impl module required
 by fastmcp's HTTP transport (only present from uvicorn >= 0.34).
 .
 This package contains the Python 3 version of the library.
